WEBVTT

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:06.610
I'll fix you soon, Build Burning.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:37.680
H-Hey...

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.230
So beautiful.

00:00:43.980 --> 00:00:44.190
Huh?

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:48.860
Your Gunpla is so beautiful.

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:00.540
Umm...

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.910
Do you mind if I use this place?

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:04.040
Go ahead.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:06.210
It's not mine, though.

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:17.340
Who is that girl?

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:22.140
Right.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:26.060
This is the upper arm, then...

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:28.190
The Gunpla is in pain.

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:28.900
What?

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:32.860
Put it in more gently.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:37.820
The Gunpla can't talk, so you must understand its feelings.

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:45.040
Now I get it.

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.000
Does this feel alright?

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.580
Um...

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:53.760
Did that Gunpla lose in battle?

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:57.220
Yeah, we were crushed to a pulp.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:59.430
He was a really strong guy.

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:00.600
Strange.

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:01.680
What is?

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.930
You lost, but you seem happy.

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:06.430
Of course it's humiliating to lose.

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.940
But my master told me...

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:14.360
Winning or losing is less important than whether you were satisfied with the match.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:19.910
Next time I fight that guy, I want to be fully prepared.

00:02:21.280 --> 00:02:24.950
Whether I win or lose, I want to be satisfied with the battle.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.120
Yeah, that's right.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.750
I'm sure Yuuma...

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:35.670
and Hoshino...

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:37.880
must feel the same way.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:42.260
So even if I'm humiliated, there's no time to feel down.

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:45.010
You remind me of...

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:47.230
Who?

00:02:51.230 --> 00:02:53.060
Let's fix your Gunpla.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:34.500
<i>As a Gunpla builder and fighter,</i>

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:36.790
<i>you're definitely lacking something.</i>

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:43.420
She taught me what it is I'm lacking.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:45.430
Hoshino.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:47.090
Yuu.

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:49.680
What happened to the Winning?

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:51.850
I had a little battle.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:55.440
Anyway, where did you go with Master Kawaguchi?

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:56.980
I was battling too.

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:57.940
With the Master?

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.690
Yes, I couldn't win a single battle.

00:05:01.190 --> 00:05:03.360
But you still look happy.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:06.530
Because I learned what I need to do.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.160
Me too.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.450
I'm going to fix the Lightning right away.

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.000
Shall we do it together?

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:14.830
Yeah.

00:05:19.630 --> 00:05:21.420
Does this part go here?

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.340
Your Gunpla seems happy.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:24.010
Is that so?

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:26.430
That voice. Is it Sekai?

00:05:26.930 --> 00:05:28.800
He's fixing a Gunpla?

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.470
Like putting salve on a wound,

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.350
Just paint the damaged parts.

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:35.940
I got it.

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:37.810
Huh?

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.030
Who's that girl?

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:49.870
She's pretty cute.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:55.620
I thought he was just a martial arts freak, but he has good taste in girls.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.290
W-Wait...

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.330
Sekai!

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:02.210
Oh, Hoshino.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:05.090
Never let a stranger touch your--

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:05.800
Who's that, Sekai?

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.220
First names, huh!?

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:08.880
She's my senior.

00:06:08.880 --> 00:06:11.800
That's true, but it's not how you should describe me!

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:13.470
Is she your girlfriend?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.020
Wh-What!?

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:16.430
No. Nothing like that.

00:06:16.430 --> 00:06:19.350
I'm sick of this cookie-cutter Q&A!

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:21.650
Hoshino, why are you mad?

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.820
And I hate that he's so dense!

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:29.570
I see. So this is youth.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:40.540
Fixing the Build Burning in one night?

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:45.050
You seem to be improving your building skills as well, Sekai.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.460
Oh, don't.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:49.050
He couldn't fix it this much on his own.

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.850
He had some help from a cute girl.

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:54.060
Oh?

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:56.220
Sekai, you're quite a guy.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:57.980
Who was she?

00:06:57.980 --> 00:07:00.810
Oh, I didn't ask her name.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:05.270
What's wrong with you, Fumina?

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.570
Your face looks bad.

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:08.490
You mean I'm pasty-faced?

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:09.490
S-Sorry.

00:07:09.490 --> 00:07:13.120
I'll repair my Winning today.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:15.370
A-Alright.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:18.250
I'll repair my Lightning, too.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.210
What'll you do, Sekai?

00:07:20.210 --> 00:07:23.290
Special training with the Build Burning, of course!

00:07:23.880 --> 00:07:26.460
Aren't you going to flirt with the cute girl?

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:28.510
I wouldn't do such a thing.

00:07:28.800 --> 00:07:29.840
Who knows?

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.590
Why are you getting mad?

00:07:31.590 --> 00:07:32.930
I'm not getting mad.

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.640
You're not getting mad?

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:35.970
Definitely not!

00:07:36.390 --> 00:07:38.930
Mr. Ral, I feel somehow itchy.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.230
My bottom feels itchy, too.

00:07:50.110 --> 00:07:51.900
Howl, fangs!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.620
<i>Over the time limit.</i>

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.000
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.540
Darn, another tie.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:07.170
How many times is that?

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.960
18 times.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:11.340
Both Gunpla are well tuned.

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.550
Adou, is your right wrist better?

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:16.050
It's healed.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:20.310
So give me stronger prey.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:22.140
Don't push too hard, Adou

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:24.980
Your fangs' movements are sluggish.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.900
That shows you're unconsciously nursing your right hand.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.530
We have two weeks untill the national tournament.

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:31.780
Rest and heal up.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.360
Well observed.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:37.240
You really are aiming to be the fourth Master, Mr. Kijima.

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.870
I'm not just aiming. I'll be him.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.460
Take it easy, will ya?

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:48.130
Your Build Burning has only just been repaired.

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.050
Let's check the machine's movements in practice mode.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:52.510
Yes, sir.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.970
It's no fun figthing with an AI.

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.430
If you wish, I'll be your opponent.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.470
You are...

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:04.730
I'm Karima Kei from Honmoku Academy, representing Kanagawa.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:08.230
You're Kamiki Sekai from Seiho Academy, right?

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:11.280
Let's play Gunpla Battle.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:15.740
Your Gunpla's moves are even better.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.330
I guess it was worthwhile studying abroad in England.

00:09:19.530 --> 00:09:22.240
Thank you for accepting my request, Uncle.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.910
Call me "Coach" here.

00:09:25.660 --> 00:09:27.080
I'm sorry.

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:32.460
We should thank Julian Mackenzie               for training you in England.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:33.510
Yes.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:36.550
Karima, you said?

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.470
Please answer one question.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.310
Why do you want to battle with Sekai?

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:46.440
Because he fought Adou Saga                  from the Gunpla Academy.

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:51.230
If I fight him, I can estimate the Academy's relative ability.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:57.030
To learn the power of the undefeated team, you're the ideal opponent.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:01.950
You mean, you want to fight the Gunpla Academy vicariously through me?

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:05.370
Otherwise, there's no point in fighting you.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:07.500
Are you mocking me?

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:08.790
How convoluted.

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:15.170
If you're so eager to know our power, challange us to battle directly.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.170
Who are you!?

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:16.970
Kijima.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.050
Kijima Wilfred.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:24.350
The Gunpla Academy's ace is going to fight me directly?

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.680
That's what you wanted.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:27.480
Kijima!

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:31.860
I won't forgive people who disdain their opponents in battle.

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:35.320
The third Master would say the same thing.

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:38.570
Hey, I was the one being challanged to a battle.

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.780
If Kijima is going to fight me, I don't need you anymore.

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:42.910
What!?

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:45.120
You guys seem to be having fun.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.040
Let us join in.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:50.250
The Gabai Institute, too?

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:53.710
Hold on a second. Don't rush ahead so quickly...

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:58.880
<i>Gunpla Battle, combat mode, startup.</i>

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.800
Master Kawaguchi!?

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.800
<b>Master Kawaguchi!?</b>

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.430
I heard it all.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:08.430
Master Kawaguchi III shall take care of this match.

00:11:08.810 --> 00:11:11.560
The teams participating in the national tournament

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.190
will enter their representatives in a Battle Royal.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.320
<i>As per tournament rules, the time limit is 15 minutes.</i>

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:19.860
<i>The damage level is set to C.</i>

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:22.110
<i>The last survivor...</i>

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:24.120
is the winner!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.370
This is a huge chance for us.

00:11:34.920 --> 00:11:37.130
I was dependent.

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:39.380
Dependent on who?

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:41.430
On you and Sekai.

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.260
I decided to build this winning

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:50.680
to amplify the special traits of you and Sekai.

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:56.320
But I was concentrating only on supportng you two.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:02.660
I forgot about fighting with my own strength.

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:06.280
You could put it more simply.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.240
Just devote yourself to what you love.

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:10.290
Like Sekai?

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.540
He's just an idiot.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:16.710
But I sometimes envy him a little.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.420
Yeah, me too.

00:12:20.420 --> 00:12:21.800
Fumina! Yuuma!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:23.680
Sekai is going to play a battle.

00:12:23.970 --> 00:12:24.590
A battle?

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:25.840
Sekai?

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.220
Who's he fighting this time?

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:32.230
It's a Battle Royal among representatives of each team.

00:12:32.230 --> 00:12:33.480
All on his own!?

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:37.770
It's already started.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:43.990
Go, Matsunaga!

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:46.120
Show them your Gabai spirit!

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:50.540
Koshiba, Uzuki, I won't waste the parts you guys gave me.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.790
That machine's from the Gunpla Academy.

00:13:01.010 --> 00:13:02.010
Good.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:18.560
N-No way.

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:19.900
He's strong...

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:21.530
What performance.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.190
That's the national champion's...

00:13:29.990 --> 00:13:31.540
The ace's Gunpla.

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:34.370
Kijima Wilfred.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:39.380
He's as strong as Adou Saga, or even more.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.010
A surprise attack!?

00:13:43.510 --> 00:13:45.550
Out of my way, Kamiki Sekai.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:49.470
Let me measure the ability of the Gunpla Academy's ace!

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:16.040
How disappointing. Such a low output.

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.160
<i>Karima Kei.</i>

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:18.330
You know my name?

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:21.380
Why didn't you use your favorite mobile armor?

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:24.590
Why would I tip my hand before the tournament!?

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:31.680
Output 540, mobility 730.

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:34.470
Particle reaction speed 0.23.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:36.310
Mediocre numbers.

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.850
He's holding back.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:40.270
What's wrong? Give it your all!

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:44.730
I'm not foolish enough to go all out against a half-hearted opponent.

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:46.530
As I expected, he's getting angry.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:47.990
Of course.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:51.160
His hunger and thirst are greater than mine.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:54.330
He's searching for an opponent he can fight seriously.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:58.080
Even the regular teams in the national tournament aren't enough.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.210
You, his only rival, are also his teammate.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:06.090
He's so brilliant that he's lonely.

00:15:07.260 --> 00:15:09.130
This will make you serious.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:10.760
Shield bits!

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:15.680
Worthless.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.530
I won't let you go!

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.630
What did you expect?

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:46.090
Kijima can fight my fangs evenly.

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:47.340
Wh-What?

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:54.550
This is the ability of the Gunpla Academy...

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.350
<i>Had enough yet?</i>

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:56.890
Huh?

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:01.270
This Build Burning is your next opponent.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:03.230
I'll give it my all.

00:16:04.690 --> 00:16:05.650
<i>Thanks.</i>

00:16:06.270 --> 00:16:09.940
I'd like to put my body and soul into a fight.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.150
Same here.

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.620
<i>Your Gunpla has no weapons?</i>

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.780
<i>The Build Burning itself is a weapon.</i>

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.700
Unlike a gun, it never runs out of bullets.

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:20.910
You're right.

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:24.250
Even in a long battle, hand-to-hand types still make sense.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:25.250
Then...

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.170
Let's do this on equal terms.

00:16:28.710 --> 00:16:30.130
No regrets!

00:16:31.670 --> 00:16:32.550
That's right!

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.720
That's the essence of Gunpla Battle!

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.050
Go, Sekai!

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.760
We're challangers!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:41.180
Yeah. Let's go, Build Burning!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.240
Jigen Haoh style!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.780
Seiken-Zuki!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.780
<i>Seiken-Zuki: Holy Fist Thrust</i>

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.250
A good fist.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:06.080
I'm getting serious.

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.010
He's keeping pace.

00:17:17.720 --> 00:17:19.430
The Build Burning's moving well.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.180
It's different from yesterday.

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:23.600
That boy's assimilation is...

00:17:23.730 --> 00:17:26.270
increased to the maximum?

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:28.900
No, that's not all.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:32.940
The performance of the Gunpla itself is much improved.

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.360
Kamiki Sekai...

00:17:37.070 --> 00:17:39.240
Did you tune up the Build Burning?

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:41.490
I just taught him how.

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.200
Why?

00:17:44.000 --> 00:17:47.750
It's no fun to fight a weak Gunpla.

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.130
Jigen Haoh style!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:55.470
Seiso-Geri!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:55.470
<i>Seiso-Geri: Holy Spear Kick</i>

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.260
Jigen Haoh style, as I thought.

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:02.640
The Build Burning's moving as I wish.

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.560
I can use that!

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:09.690
Jigen Haoh style!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:14.530
Hado Reppaku-Ken!

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:14.530
<i>Hado Reppaku-Ken: Rending Wave Fist</i>

00:18:23.870 --> 00:18:24.620
Did I do it?

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:29.290
You stopped it!

00:18:29.750 --> 00:18:31.210
You're awesome!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.590
So are you, I must say!

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:39.050
Againts Kijima Wilfrid,

00:18:39.510 --> 00:18:41.600
he's fighting equally...

00:18:42.260 --> 00:18:44.310
The two machines have output 1400...

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:45.890
mobility 200.

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:49.100
Particle reaction speed 0.11.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:51.190
It's still increasing.

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.440
Darn.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.230
Let me play, too.

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:59.360
Sekai's great.

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:01.700
Hoshino...

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:06.580
He's stupid, thoughtless, insensitive and bad-tempered.

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.790
The sight of him irritates me.

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:10.620
But that guy...

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:12.130
Kamiki Sekai...

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:14.960
He's our ace!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.300
Let's go, Build Burning!

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:21.800
We can go further!

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:25.390
Gotcha.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:29.890
Go beyond this...!

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:30.980
What!?

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.590
Th-This power is...

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:03.430
What the--?

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:04.760
That technique...

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:07.180
It's not Jigen Haoh style.

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:11.310
Now they're beyond measure.

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.650
Magnificent.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.270
They can rage on this far.

00:20:19.280 --> 00:20:22.150
<i>Object crash. State change.</i>

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:44.590
<i>Over the time limit.</i>

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:46.260
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:52.100
Kamiki...

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.100
Kamiki Sekai!

00:20:58.060 --> 00:20:59.400
I got it.

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.200
You're leaving already?

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:07.030
Yes.

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:11.580
To observe the last representative team in the final round of the Osaka qualifiers.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:14.920
Miss Hoshino, do you know what you were lacking?

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:18.460
I'll show you the answer in the national tournament.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:22.630
And someday, I'll become a fighter who can surpass you.

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:24.380
What a big mouth.

00:21:24.550 --> 00:21:27.760
But before saying that, go and defeat that girl first.

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:29.140
That girl?

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:31.850
You'll see when the national tournament starts.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:35.310
Kousaka, I'll give you these words.

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:37.100
Try hard!

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:39.690
That's for cheering on others.

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:41.570
That's right.

00:21:42.730 --> 00:21:43.280
Go!

00:21:47.200 --> 00:21:48.820
We should build some Gunpla.

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:49.950
Right.

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:52.410
Not only our Gunpla,

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:55.870
but we also need to upgrade Sekai's Build Burning.

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.040
Right now, the machine can't endure those techniques.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.840
Let's build. All three of us.

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:06.220
Yeah. All three of us.

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:42.020
You're really late.

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:47.480
Where have you been wasting your time, Shia?

00:23:47.940 --> 00:23:49.240
Sorry, big brother.

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:55.160
Kijima Shia, now returned from studying abroad in England.

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:58.910
I'm joining the regular team of the Gunpla Academy.

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:03.790
To win the national tournament, using what we learnt at training camp,

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:05.790
we have to build new Gunpla!

00:24:05.790 --> 00:24:07.670
Next Episode, "Worthy Rivals."

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:09.420
More new rivals are showing up!?
